WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.534 --> 00:00:02.534
-Hey, you guys, be sure
to tune in Wednesday night.

00:00:02.534 --> 00:00:03.734
-Why's that?
-Something very exciting

00:00:03.734 --> 00:00:04.901
is going down --
we're taking "The Tonight Show"

00:00:04.901 --> 00:00:06.901
into "Fortnite."
-Ooh.

00:00:06.901 --> 00:00:09.634
-That's right. We've teamed up
with Samsung to do this.

00:00:09.634 --> 00:00:11.367
It's called
"Tonight at the Rock,

00:00:11.367 --> 00:00:13.133
Powered by Samsung Galaxy."

00:00:13.133 --> 00:00:15.868
It's a gaming experience
you can play in "Fortnite."

00:00:15.868 --> 00:00:18.000
We recreated everything --
Rockefeller Center,

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:19.501
the "30 Rock" building,
our offices --

00:00:19.501 --> 00:00:21.267
every little detail
of the studio,

00:00:21.267 --> 00:00:22.667
it's like you're right here,

00:00:22.667 --> 00:00:25.200
and the attention to detail
is pretty mind-blowing.

00:00:25.200 --> 00:00:26.968
You can explore around.
There's all these mini games

00:00:26.968 --> 00:00:29.200
you can play, games we play
on "The Tonight Show"

00:00:29.200 --> 00:00:30.868
and games that we made
just for "Fortnite"

00:00:30.868 --> 00:00:32.667
with Samsung Galaxy Power Boost.

00:00:32.667 --> 00:00:34.601
It's really cool.
We're very excited.

00:00:34.601 --> 00:00:36.400
So call all your friends
around the world

00:00:36.400 --> 00:00:37.400
and start playing.

00:00:37.400 --> 00:00:38.734
Tune into the show
Wednesday night,

00:00:38.734 --> 00:00:40.167
and thank you to "Fortnite"
and thank you

00:00:40.167 --> 00:00:41.868
to everyone at Samsung.

00:00:41.868 --> 00:00:43.334
It's good. It's cool.

00:00:43.334 --> 00:00:44.634
-I got to see it.

